1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,820
Want to exfoliate without leaving your skin feeling dry?

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:08,652
In this review, we look at the Dermalogica Hydro Masque Exfoliant: what it is,

3
00:00:08,652 --> 00:00:10,635
what's in it, and how to use it.

4
00:00:11,397 --> 00:00:14,797
It's a five-minute masque that does two jobs at once.

5
00:00:14,797 --> 00:00:16,785
It exfoliates, and it hydrates.

6
00:00:16,785 --> 00:00:20,570
The result it's made for is luminous, healthy-looking skin.

7
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:23,845
The exfoliating part comes from bamboo.

8
00:00:23,845 --> 00:00:29,325
Exfoliating bamboo smooths the skin and primes it for hydration, so what comes next

9
00:00:29,325 --> 00:00:30,315
can do its job.

10
00:00:30,315 --> 00:00:33,748
It's the exfoliating half of this two-in-one masque.

11
00:00:34,514 --> 00:00:37,330
The hydrating part comes from snow mushroom.

12
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:42,322
Snow mushroom is the hydrator in this masque, alongside sodium hyaluronate and

13
00:00:42,322 --> 00:00:44,370
glycerin in the ingredient list.

14
00:00:45,134 --> 00:00:50,349
Jojoba esters and amino acids from sugar beets help strengthen your skin's moisture

15
00:00:50,349 --> 00:00:50,852
barrier.

16
00:00:51,615 --> 00:00:56,231
And cucumber extract gives a soothing finish, so your skin feels calm when you rinse

17
00:00:56,231 --> 00:00:56,616
it off.

18
00:00:57,371 --> 00:00:59,696
So, a quick recap of what's inside.

19
00:00:59,696 --> 00:01:01,024
Bamboo to exfoliate.

20
00:01:01,024 --> 00:01:04,212
Snow mushroom and sodium hyaluronate to hydrate.

21
00:01:04,212 --> 00:01:08,995
Jojoba esters and amino acids from sugar beets for the moisture barrier.

22
00:01:08,995 --> 00:01:11,851
And cucumber extract for a soothing finish.

23
00:01:11,851 --> 00:01:15,504
Every one of those is named in the product description.

24
00:01:16,204 --> 00:01:17,450
Here's how to use it.

25
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:19,052
Start with a cleansed face.

26
00:01:19,052 --> 00:01:23,799
Then apply the masque generously over your face and neck, avoiding the eye area.

27
00:01:24,499 --> 00:01:29,477
Massage it in using circular motions, until the little spheres in the formula

28
00:01:29,477 --> 00:01:30,124
disappear.

29
00:01:30,124 --> 00:01:32,839
That massage is part of how it exfoliates.

30
00:01:33,604 --> 00:01:35,741
Leave it on for three to five minutes.

31
00:01:35,741 --> 00:01:38,216
That's why it's called a five-minute masque.

32
00:01:38,216 --> 00:01:39,791
It fits into a busy evening.

33
00:01:40,491 --> 00:01:43,499
Then rinse thoroughly with water, and pat your skin dry.

34
00:01:44,199 --> 00:01:47,399
Follow with your moisturizer, to seal in the hydration.

35
00:01:48,099 --> 00:01:49,842
Use it once or twice a week.

36
00:01:49,842 --> 00:01:54,573
The ingredient list can change, so check the packaging for the current list.

37
00:01:54,573 --> 00:01:59,305
If your skin feels dull and dry, this masque exfoliates and hydrates in five

38
00:01:59,305 --> 00:01:59,803
minutes.

39
00:01:59,803 --> 00:02:01,733
The link is in the description.
